/*
	scripts/codol/aitype/enemy_dog_mp.gsc

	Adapted from the shipped Black Ops (T5) script source:
		D:\CoD\COD-GSC-Source\T5-STEAM-GSC\aitype\enemy_dog_mp.gsc
	(T5 marks it autogenerated; the QUAKED spawner block is the map-entity
	contract maps\mp\_dogs::dog_manager_spawn_dogs spawns from, so it is kept
	verbatim.)

	Changed for CoDOL:
	  - self.weapon = "" replaced by the C1 bite WeaponDef name, sourced from
	    maps\mp\_dogs::dog_bite_weapon() so the name lives in one place.  T5
	    leaves .weapon empty here and sets .aiweapon in _dogs::init_dog; the
	    aitype is also the only thing a preexisting BSP dog runs, so it names
	    the weapon too.
	  - self.team = "axis" kept; maps\mp\_dogs::dog_set_team overrides
	    .aiteam per call-in.
	  - the character script main()/precache() chain is unchanged except that
	    character_mp_german_shepherd now resolves the model through
	    maps\mp\_dogs (C1 has no "german_shepherd" model - see that file).
*/

// THIS FILE IS AUTOGENERATED, DO NOT MODIFY
/*QUAKED actor_enemy_dog_mp (1.0 0.25 0.0) (-16 -16 0) (16 16 72) SPAWNER MAKEROOM UNDELETABLE ENEMYINFO SCRIPT_FORCESPAWN SM_PRIORITY
defaultmdl="german_sheperd_dog"
"count" -- max AI to ever spawn from this spawner
SPAWNER -- makes this a spawner instead of a guy
MAKEROOM -- will try to delete an AI if spawning fails from too many AI
UNDELETABLE -- this AI (or AI spawned from here) cannot be deleted to make room for MAKEROOM guys
ENEMYINFO -- this AI when spawned will get a snapshot of perfect info about all enemies
SCRIPT_FORCESPAWN -- this AI will spawned even if players can see him spawning.
SM_PRIORITY -- Make the Spawn Manager spawn from this spawner before other spawners.
*/
main()
{
	self.animTree = "dog.atr";
	self.team = "axis";
	self.type = "dog";
	self.accuracy = 1;
	self.health = 200;
	self.weapon = maps\mp\_dogs::dog_bite_weapon();
	self.secondaryweapon = "";
	self.sidearm = "";
	self.grenadeWeapon = "";
	self.grenadeAmmo = 0;
	self.csvInclude = "";

	self setEngagementMinDist( 0.000000, 0.000000 );
	self setEngagementMaxDist( 100.000000, 300.000000 );

	character\character_mp_german_shepherd::main();
}

spawner()
{
	self setspawnerteam("axis");
}

precache()
{
	character\character_mp_german_shepherd::precache();

}
